{"seq":1,"slug":"cold-start-optimization","title":"冷启动速度优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/performance/cold-start-optimization","wordCount":916,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"冷启动速度优化\">冷启动速度优化</h1><p>Electron 应用的冷启动速度是用户体验的第一关——从双击图标到界面完整可交互，典型未优化的 Electron 应用需要 1.5-3 秒，而 VS Code 将这个数字压缩到了 400ms 以内。差距不在框架本身，而在启动路径上的冗余操作、资源加载效率和缓存策略。本文提供一套从 1.8 秒压缩到 500ms 以内的系统性优化方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Electron 冷启动经历五个串行阶段，每个阶段都有可优化的空间：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[OS 加载&lt;br/&gt;Electron 二进制] --&gt; B[主进程初始化&lt;br/&gt;Node.js 启动]&#10;    B --&gt; C[BrowserWindow&lt;br/&gt;创建]&#10;    C --&gt; D[渲染进程启动&lt;br/&gt;HTML/JS 加载]&#10;    D --&gt; E[首屏渲染&lt;br/&gt;可交互]&#10;&#10;    A -.-&gt;|~200ms| B&#10;    B -.-&gt;|~300ms| C&#10;    C -.-&gt;|~100ms| D&#10;    D -.-&gt;|~800ms| E\">graph LR\n    A[OS 加载&lt;br/&gt;Electron 二进制] --&gt; B[主进程初始化&lt;br/&gt;Node.js 启动]\n    B --&gt; C[BrowserWindow&lt;br/&gt;创建]\n    C --&gt; D[渲染进程启动&lt;br/&gt;HTML/JS 加载]\n    D --&gt; E[首屏渲染&lt;br/&gt;可交互]\n\n    A -.-&gt;|~200ms| B\n    B -.-&gt;|~300ms| C\n    C -.-&gt;|~100ms| D\n    D -.-&gt;|~800ms| E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化阶段</th>\n<th>目标时间</th>\n<th>核心手段</th>\n<th>预期收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主进程初始化</td>\n<td>&lt; 150ms</td>\n<td>延迟加载、避免同步 I/O</td>\n<td>30-40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>窗口创建</td>\n<td>&lt; 50ms</td>\n<td>预热窗口池、禁用硬件加速</td>\n<td>20-30%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渲染进程加载</td>\n<td>&lt; 200ms</td>\n<td>代码分割、Tree-shaking</td>\n<td>15-25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首屏渲染</td>\n<td>&lt; 100ms</td>\n<td>V8 代码缓存、骨架屏</td>\n<td>15-20%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"禁用硬件加速\">禁用硬件加速</h2><p>这是最简单且效果最显著的优化——在低配电脑或特定显卡驱动环境下，GPU 初始化可能耗时 200-500ms。对于不依赖 WebGL/Canvas 3D 渲染的应用，禁用硬件加速几乎无副作用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 必须在 app.whenReady() 之前调用&#10;app.disableHardwareAcceleration();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 必须在 app.whenReady() 之前调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">disableHardwareAcceleration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实测效果：某企业级 RPA 工具禁用后冷启动从 1.8 秒降至 1.1 秒，提升 39%。在高配电脑上差异可能不明显，但对用户群中的长尾低配设备来说，这是立竿见影的改善。</p>\n<h2 id=\"v8-代码缓存\">V8 代码缓存</h2><p>V8 引擎在首次执行 JavaScript 时需要经历解析（Parse）→ 编译（Compile）→ 执行三个阶段。开启代码缓存后，编译结果被持久化到磁盘，后续启动直接加载已编译的字节码，跳过解析和编译阶段。这是 VS Code 的核心优化手段之一。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 在 BrowserWindow 的 webPreferences 中启用&#10;const win = new BrowserWindow({&#10;  webPreferences: {&#10;    v8CacheOptions: &#39;bypassHeatCheck&#39;, // 首次执行即缓存&#10;    // 或 &#39;code&#39; - 仅缓存热点代码（默认行为）&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 BrowserWindow 的 webPreferences 中启用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> win</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BrowserWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  webPreferences: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    v8CacheOptions: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'bypassHeatCheck'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 首次执行即缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 或 'code' - 仅缓存热点代码（默认行为）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>bypassHeatCheck</code> 选项让 V8 跳过热度检测，首次执行的代码就会被缓存。对于 Electron 应用这种启动路径固定的场景，这是合理的选择——启动脚本每次都会执行，没有「不够热」的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟加载策略\">延迟加载策略</h2><p>主进程启动时加载的模块越少，初始化越快。将非关键模块延迟到实际需要时再加载：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 反模式：顶层全量导入&#10;import { autoUpdater } from &#39;electron-updater&#39;;&#10;import Database from &#39;better-sqlite3&#39;;&#10;import ffmpeg from &#39;fluent-ffmpeg&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 正确方式：延迟动态导入&#10;let autoUpdater: typeof import(&#39;electron-updater&#39;).autoUpdater;&#10;&#10;async function checkForUpdates() {&#10;  if (!autoUpdater) {&#10;    const mod = await import(&#39;electron-updater&#39;);&#10;    autoUpdater = mod.autoUpdater;&#10;  }&#10;  autoUpdater.checkForUpdatesAndNotify();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 反模式：顶层全量导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { autoUpdater } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'electron-updater'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Database </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'better-sqlite3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ffmpeg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fluent-ffmpeg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确方式：延迟动态导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> autoUpdater</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> typeof</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'electron-updater'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).autoUpdater;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkForUpdates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">autoUpdater) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mod</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'electron-updater'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    autoUpdater </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mod.autoUpdater;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  autoUpdater.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">checkForUpdatesAndNotify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>具体策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自动更新检查：延迟到应用启动后 5-10 秒</li>\n<li>数据库连接：延迟到首次数据请求</li>\n<li>全局快捷键注册：延迟到窗口显示后</li>\n<li>托盘图标创建：延迟到主窗口 ready-to-show 之后</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"窗口延迟显示与骨架屏\">窗口延迟显示与骨架屏</h2><p>在渲染进程尚未完成首屏渲染时就显示窗口会导致白屏闪烁。正确的做法是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const win = new BrowserWindow({&#10;  show: false, // 创建时不显示&#10;  backgroundColor: &#39;#1e1e1e&#39;, // 与应用背景色一致，减少感知差异&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 方案 A：等渲染完成再显示&#10;win.once(&#39;ready-to-show&#39;, () =&gt; win.show());&#10;&#10;// 方案 B：先显示骨架屏（嵌在 HTML 中的内联 CSS）再加载完整 JS&#10;// index.html 中包含纯 CSS 骨架屏，JS 加载完成后替换\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> win</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BrowserWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  show: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 创建时不显示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  backgroundColor: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#1e1e1e'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 与应用背景色一致，减少感知差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方案 A：等渲染完成再显示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">win.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">once</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ready-to-show'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> win.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">show</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 方案 B：先显示骨架屏（嵌在 HTML 中的内联 CSS）再加载完整 JS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// index.html 中包含纯 CSS 骨架屏，JS 加载完成后替换</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"渲染进程代码分割\">渲染进程代码分割</h2><p>渲染进程的 JavaScript 包体积直接影响首屏时间。使用 Vite 的代码分割确保只加载首屏必需的代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// vite.config.ts (renderer)&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  build: {&#10;    rollupOptions: {&#10;      output: {&#10;        manualChunks: {&#10;          vendor: [&#39;react&#39;, &#39;react-dom&#39;],&#10;          // 大型库独立分块，首屏不需要的模块延迟加载&#10;        },&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 路由级懒加载&#10;const Settings = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Settings&#39;));&#10;const Editor = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Editor&#39;));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// vite.config.ts (renderer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  build: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rollupOptions: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      output: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        manualChunks: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          vendor: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'react-dom'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 大型库独立分块，首屏不需要的模块延迟加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 路由级懒加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Settings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lazy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./pages/Settings'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Editor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lazy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./pages/Editor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"预热窗口池\">预热窗口池</h2><p>对于需要频繁创建窗口的应用（如多标签页编辑器），可预先创建隐藏窗口作为缓存池：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class WindowPool {&#10;  private pool: BrowserWindow[] = [];&#10;&#10;  warmUp(count: number): void {&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; count; i++) {&#10;      const win = new BrowserWindow({&#10;        show: false,&#10;        webPreferences: {&#10;          /* 标准安全配置 */&#10;        },&#10;      });&#10;      win.loadFile(&#39;empty.html&#39;); // 加载空白页预热渲染进程&#10;      this.pool.push(win);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  acquire(): BrowserWindow {&#10;    return this.pool.pop() ?? this.createFresh();&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WindowPool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> pool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BrowserWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  warmUp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> win</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BrowserWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        show: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        webPreferences: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          /* 标准安全配置 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      win.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">loadFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'empty.html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 加载空白页预热渲染进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pool.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(win);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  acquire</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BrowserWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pool.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createFresh</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"启动性能度量\">启动性能度量</h2><p>没有度量就没有优化。在启动路径的关键节点埋点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// main.ts&#10;const t0 = performance.now();&#10;app.whenReady().then(() =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(`[perf] app ready: ${performance.now() - t0}ms`);&#10;  const win = createMainWindow();&#10;  win.webContents.once(&#39;did-finish-load&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    console.log(`[perf] first paint: ${performance.now() - t0}ms`);&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// main.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">whenReady</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">then</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`[perf] app ready: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">performance</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> win</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createMainWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  win.webContents.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">once</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'did-finish-load'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`[perf] first paint: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">performance</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>禁用硬件加速是最简单高效的优化，对低配设备提升可达 39%</li>\n<li>V8 代码缓存跳过 JS 解析编译，二次启动提速 15-20%</li>\n<li>延迟加载非关键模块，主进程初始化只做窗口创建</li>\n<li><code>show: false</code> + <code>ready-to-show</code> 消除白屏闪烁</li>\n<li>代码分割 + 路由懒加载确保首屏只加载必需代码</li>\n<li>在关键路径埋点度量，用数据驱动优化决策</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"memory-management\">运行时内存管理</a>——启动优化之后的长期运行内存治理</li>\n<li><a href=\"/hubs/frontend/web-performance-vitals/\">Web 性能核心指标</a>——性能度量的通用方法论与指标体系</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"冷启动速度优化","id":"冷启动速度优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"禁用硬件加速","id":"禁用硬件加速"},{"level":2,"text":"V8 代码缓存","id":"v8-代码缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟加载策略","id":"延迟加载策略"},{"level":2,"text":"窗口延迟显示与骨架屏","id":"窗口延迟显示与骨架屏"},{"level":2,"text":"渲染进程代码分割","id":"渲染进程代码分割"},{"level":2,"text":"预热窗口池","id":"预热窗口池"},{"level":2,"text":"启动性能度量","id":"启动性能度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"现代工程化工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/development/toolchain-engineering"},"next":{"title":"运行时内存管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/electron-desktop/performance/memory-management"}}